<Placemark><name>LTEE reaches 80,000 generations (2024 milestone); lab moves MSU → UT Austin</name><description>Grade: CORROBORATED — Multiple independent secondary reports (IFLScience, Works in Progress) describing the lab's own reporting of the 80,000-generation milestone and the institutional handoff; graded as the reported milestone, not as a peer-reviewed finding — the Cit+ innovation itself is already carried on evt-common-descent-001.
