<Placemark><name>The '40,000-year-old writing' headline telling</name><description>Grade: DEBUNKED — The study's authors state explicitly the marks do not encode spoken language and do not qualify as writing in the strict sense; statistical parity with proto-cuneiform (the 22 sign types, the entropy metrics) is about complexity, not language — the headline asserts what the paper denies.
